      "name": "retry-plan.md",
      "note": "A plan: headings, paragraphs, lists, a table, code, a quote, a rule",
      "text": "# Retry plan for the relay client\n\nStatus: **draft** · Owner: `relay` · Target: next release\n\n## Problem\n\nThe client drops its socket when the laptop sleeps and never comes back.\nIt retries at once, three times, then gives up.\n\n## Proposal\n\n1. Retry with a growing wait, capped at 60 seconds.\n2. Add jitter so a fleet does not retry in step.\n5. Stop after ten minutes and say so.\n\n- [x] Reproduce on a sleeping laptop\n- [ ] Ship behind a flag\n  - nested bullet\n    continued on the next line\n* star bullet\n\n  A loose paragraph inside the item.\n\n| Attempt | Wait | Jitter |\n|---|---:|:---:|\n| 1 | 1 s | 250 ms |\n| 2 | 2 s | 250 ms |\n| 6+ | 60 s | `250 ms` |\n\n```ts\nconst wait = Math.min(60_000, 1000 * 2 ** tries)\nawait sleep(wait + jitter(250))\n```\n\n> Ten minutes is a guess.\n> Measure before the release.\n\n---\n\n### Open questions\n\n#123 is not a heading, and neither is #hashtag.\n",
